  - evidence_type: MANUAL_CURATION
    source: MIM curation (#260)
    notes: 'Added ''L-glutathione reduced'' as a EXACT_SYNONYM (#260): CHEBI:16856
      ''glutathione'' IS the reduced form (GSH) — the record already lists `Reduced
      glutathione` and `GSH`, and the oxidised form is a separate record on CHEBI:17858.
      The `L-` and `reduced` qualifiers add nothing the term does not already fix.
      CultureMech uses this surface form and label_index did not contain it, so the
      lookup missed. No new record: CHEBI:16856 is this record''s identifier, and
      in MIM the identifier IS the ontology CURIE, so a second record on it would
      be a duplicate primary key rather than added coverage.'
